bshot: BAUXBSD screenshot utility

This package provides a unified screenshot tool that works in both X11
and console framebuffer environments. It automatically detects the
display environment and uses appropriate tools (maim for X11, fbgrab
for console).

Features:
- Universal: Works in X11 and console framebuffer
- Consistent: Same interface across all BAUX layers
- Simple: No dialogs, no clipboard prompts
- Organized: Timestamped files in ~/shots/

WWW: https://github.com/RoxieOS/baux-shot